RM75-6FB-V description asset provenance
=======================================

The arm and wrist-camera URDF geometry, inertial parameters, transforms and
STL meshes in this directory were migrated from the supplied package:

  extensions/资料/URDF_RM75-6FB-V/URDF_RM75-6FB-V

That package declares the BSD license in package.xml. OpenETA changed the ROS
package URI, fixed camera_rojoint at its zero/default mounting pose, added the
wrist optical frame and Gazebo RGB-D sensor, and factored the ros2_control arm
interfaces into a reusable xacro macro. The original link and joint names and
all arm/camera CAD and inertial values remain unchanged.
